        </div>
        <div class="mech-text">
          <h3 class="mech-title">A Nerve You've Never Heard Of</h3>
          <p class="mech-body">The posterior tibial nerve runs from the inner ankle to the sacral nerve center (S2-S4) in your lower spine. This nerve center controls your bladder: when to squeeze, when to relax. Every trip to the bathroom, every hold, every release is governed by signals traveling this pathway.</p>
        </div>
